# SirhurryUp Agentic AI Engineering

## Mission
Design, build, test, and deploy intelligent AI agents that
reduce repetitive administrative work and help organizations
focus on their core mission.

## Project 01: Research Intelligence Agent

An AI-powered research assistant designed to help principal
investigators streamline grant writing, progress reporting,
and retrieval of previous research information.

### Initial Capabilities
- Retrieve information from approved research documents.
- Generate source-grounded grant narratives.
- Identify missing information requiring PI review.
- Support personalized writing styles.
- Maintain a reusable research knowledge base.

## Engineering Principles
- Learn, build, verify, document, and commit.
- Human approval for scientific claims and submissions.
- Secure handling of research documents.
- Reusable architecture for future business applications.
- Continuous testing and documentation.

## Current Status
Week 1 — Project initialization and AI agent fundamentals.

## Technology Stack
Python, LLM APIs, FastAPI, PostgreSQL, Docker, and AWS.

Technologies will be introduced incrementally as needed.